Controls to include:
1. Parser fixture (well-formed known entry, e.g., id_list=1711.11380 returns title).
2. Positive control: a row known TOP_HIT_MATCH should also title-match directly (consistency).
3. Negative control: a nonsense id_list should return 0 entries (not a fetch error).
4. Idempotence: repeat one call, byte-identical (or entry-id set identical; arXiv may add timestamps? The XML may include updated dates which are stable).
5. Corpus validity: pin citation_audit.csv sha256 = 315c19145065... before and after.

