- CLAIMED_WORK_RESOLVES_TITLE_MATCH: direct fetch of claimed arxiv_id returns an entry whose title normalizes to the claimed title.
- CLAIMED_WORK_RESOLVES_TITLE_MISMATCH: entry exists but title differs → row-level citation content defect.
- CLAIMED_ID_NOT_FOUND: arXiv returns no entry for the claimed id → phantom id.
- FETCH_ERROR.

Falsifier: re-run at the pinned ledger hash; falsified if any row's direct resolution class changes, or if a control returns false. Also falsified if a row classified TITLE_MISMATCH in fact has a normalizable-equivalent title under the declared normalization (so normalization must be pre-registered and explicit).

